; Sprites: stick figure (4 frames), spear guard and plumed guard (2 + 2 frames)
;
; Eight 16x16 sprites of 32 bytes, 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes each (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel). Sprite
; F of the page is at $BF00+32*F. Entity definitions (#R$A000) name the page in byte +5 and pick F from the animation
; phase, the direction and the slot data. The sprites are drawn with #R$9456 (#R$91BE) and have no colour of their own:
; ink and bright come from the entity definition. Frames 0-3 look like a figure with raised arms and a diagonal stick
; (entities $06-$09 and $0B, e.g. At the Foot of the MegaTree, room $03). Frames 4-5 look like a guard with a pointed
; cap and an upright spear; frames 6-7 the same with a wider hat (entities $02-$05 in The Security Guard, room $05, and
; rooms $0E, $0F, $11). Used by entity definitions $02 $03 $04 $05 $06 $07 $08 $09 $0B in rooms $03 $05 $08 $09 $0E $0F
; $11 $28 $30 $39.
@label=SpritesImpsGuards
